- jscallback-bool-returns-crash (js-callback.c): `new JSCallback(fn, { returns: 'bool' })` throws
  `TypeError: cannot read property 'length' of undefined` from inside the native
  constructor. Confirmed against both the system libffi build and a
  BUILD_LIBFFI=ON (vendored libffi) build, so it's not a libffi-variant issue.
  Not yet root-caused.

    import { JSCallback } from 'ffi';
    new JSCallback(() => true, { returns: 'bool' });

